Hi!

TimeBrowse v0.3 is released!
http://sourceforge.net/projects/timebrowse/

This time 'restore' and 'thumbnail' are implemented in nautilus property page.
To display thumbnail, it requires evince and pisa.
Also, you can view the file by double clicking the history entry.

I'm using python-evince 2.30.0.  It may have problem with other version.
If you have problem, please check ~/.xsession-errors for further information.

Changes are following.

TimeBrowse-v0.3  Sat Feb 19 20:17:19 JST 2011
        * add restore button to resotre to the original place
        * view the file by double click in history list
        * add thumbnail of the files in history
        * better pretty format
        * fix a bug that mixed history on multilple NILFS volumes 

nilfs2_ss_manager-v0.3  Sat Feb 19 20:17:19 JST 2011
        * do not write to mtab for snapshot mount
        * use tmpfs to mount snapshonts on nilfs volume

enjoy!
